---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Aaron Holmes | Business Systems & Automation"
  description="Business systems automation, CRM architecture, API integrations, workflow design, and technical consulting."
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero container">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        Business Systems · Automation · Integrations · Technical Consulting
      </p>

      <h1>
        I make complicated business systems easier to understand, automate, and
        maintain.
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        I work across business process automation, CRM systems, APIs, integrations,
        and operational workflows. I learn how a business actually works, identify
        bottlenecks and failure points, and translate those requirements into
        systems that are more reliable, maintainable, and easier for teams to use.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-links">
        <a class="primary-link" href="#experience">Experience</a>
        <a href="#projects">Selected work</a>
        <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="experience" class="section container">
      <p class="section-label">Experience</p>

      <div class="role-block">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h2>Business Systems Automation</h2>
            <p class="role-company">Lincoln Health Supply</p>
          </div>

          <p class="role-meta">Healthcare · DME · Remote · 2025–Present</p>
        </div>

        <p class="role-summary">
          Owned and modernized a large healthcare automation environment spanning
          hundreds of Zapier workflows plus Zoho CRM, Zoho One applications,
          Deluge, REST APIs, webhooks, document workflows, and external services.
          Worked independently with direct access to business leadership,
          translating operational requirements into maintainable technical systems.
        </p>

        <ul class="experience-list">
          <li>
            Managed and reverse-engineered a complex production environment with
            hundreds of workflows, workflow rules, and custom functions supporting
            patient intake, eligibility, prescriptions, documents, orders, and
            follow-up processes.
          </li>

          <li>
            Designed a centralized duplicate-processing system to replace
            scattered duplicate logic, improving consistency, auditability, and
            control over ownership, supplier assignment, and request creation.
          </li>

          <li>
            Built a custom Zapier integration for pVerify eligibility workflows,
            including authentication, token handling, request formatting, and
            normalization of payer and patient data.
          </li>

          <li>
            Built and troubleshot prescription and document fax automation across
            Zoho, document-generation tools, PDF processing, cloud storage, and
            telecom integrations where standard connector behavior was
            insufficient.
          </li>

          <li>
            Led the systems work required to introduce compression garments as a
            new product line, integrating the new workflow into existing intake,
            CRM, request, supplier, and fulfillment processes.
          </li>

          <li>
            Prioritized explicit logging, traceability, and documentation so
            automation behavior could be understood by operations leadership,
            future technical staff, and outside stakeholders rather than relying
            on undocumented institutional knowledge.
          </li>

          <li>
            Trained another employee on Zapier and Zoho workflows and began
            transferring system knowledge out of a one-person technical function.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="role-block">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h2>Business Systems & Automation Consultant</h2>
            <p class="role-company">AviKaiDo</p>
          </div>

          <p class="role-meta">Project-based engagements · 2015–Present</p>
        </div>

        <p class="role-summary">
          Deliver business systems, workflow automation, integrations, and web
          solutions across financial services, healthcare, SaaS, media, real
          estate, and small-business environments. The work has evolved from web
          development into increasingly complex automation, data, and systems
          consulting.
        </p>

        <ul class="experience-list">
          <li>
            Built lead-intake, market-data enrichment, prospecting, and
            document-generation workflows for international securities-backed
            lending, combining borrower and ticker data with market history,
            financial metrics, and LTV scenarios to support evaluation of
            high-value opportunities.
          </li>

          <li>
            Designed and prototyped healthcare CRM and integration workflows for
            Ask Your Primary, including pharmacy-specific QR intake, patient-data
            mapping, and fax-to-record integration. That engagement led directly
            to work with Lincoln Health Supply.
          </li>

          <li>
            Developed automated content-ingestion and rules-based classification
            workflows for TheRedZone.org and resolved recurring production
            performance issues caused by excessive caching.
          </li>

          <li>
            Provide project-based integration and workflow automation support for
            TixWork, a multi-unit operations SaaS platform used across 100+
            restaurant locations, with additional contributions to sales and
            enterprise customer support as needed.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="projects" class="section container">
      <p class="section-label">Selected technical work</p>

      <div class="project-grid">
        <article class="project-card">
          <p class="project-kicker">Automation architecture</p>
          <h2>Duplicate Processing Redesign</h2>
          <p>
            Consolidated duplicate-handling rules into a more centralized,
            auditable process designed to prevent workflow conflicts and preserve
            intended owner, supplier, and request behavior.
          </p>
          <p class="project-tech">
            Zoho CRM · Deluge · Zapier · Workflow Design
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="project-card">
          <p class="project-kicker">API integration</p>
          <h2>pVerify Eligibility Integration</h2>
          <p>
            Built a custom Zapier integration for healthcare eligibility checks,
            including authentication, bearer-token handling, API requests, data
            normalization, and CRM workflow integration.
          </p>
          <p class="project-tech">
            REST APIs · Authentication · Zapier Developer Platform · JSON
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="project-card">
          <p class="project-kicker">Financial services automation</p>
          <h2>Securities-Lending Workflow Automation</h2>
          <p>
            Built intake, data-enrichment, prospecting, and document-generation
            workflows for international securities-backed lending using borrower
            data, ticker history, financial metrics, and LTV scenarios.
          </p>
          <p class="project-tech">
            Data Enrichment · Document Automation · WordPress · Workflow Design
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="project-card">
          <p class="project-kicker">Content automation</p>
          <h2>TheRedZone.org</h2>
          <p>
            Developed automated article-ingestion and rules-based classification
            workflows for an NFL news platform and resolved recurring performance
            issues related to large caching requirements.
          </p>
          <p class="project-tech">
            Content Ingestion · Rules-Based Classification · Production Troubleshooting
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="skills" class="section container">
      <p class="section-label">Technical toolkit</p>

      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div>
          <h2>Automation & CRM</h2>
          <p>
            Zapier, Zoho CRM, Zoho One, workflow architecture, conditional logic,
            data mapping, debugging, run-history analysis, process documentation
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>APIs & Integrations</h2>
          <p>
            REST APIs, webhooks, JSON, OAuth concepts, bearer tokens, API keys,
            authentication flows, request/response troubleshooting, custom
            integrations
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>Development & Cloud</h2>
          <p>
            Deluge, JavaScript, Python fundamentals, SQL fundamentals, Astro, Git,
            GitHub, VS Code, Cloudflare Pages, AWS EC2, cloud compute, storage
            configuration, and Linux environments
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>Business Systems</h2>
          <p>
            Requirements discovery, process mapping, CRM architecture, systems
            integration, production troubleshooting, technical training,
            stakeholder communication, and documentation
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container">
      <p class="section-label">How I work</p>

      <h2>Learn the business first. Automate the right problem second.</h2>

      <p>
        I enjoy learning how different businesses and teams operate. Cross-industry
        experience helps me anticipate bottlenecks, identify conflicting
        assumptions, and ask focused questions without disrupting the people doing
        the work. That discovery process is what allows me to design integrations
        and automation around the real workflow rather than an idealized version of
        it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section container contact-section">
      <p class="section-label">Contact</p>

      <h2>Interested in automation, integrations, or systems work?</h2>

      <p>
        I am most interested in remote roles where technical problem-solving,
        communication, and business-process understanding overlap.
      </p>

      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: 5rem 4.5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-label,
  .project-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
  }

  .hero-links,
  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem 1.4rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .primary-link {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .section {
    width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--content-width));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section > h2,
  .role-header h2,
  .project-card h2,
  .skills-grid h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .section > h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .section > p:not(.section-label) {
    max-width: var(--reading-width);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .role-block + .role-block {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding-top: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .role-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .role-header h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .role-company,
  .role-meta {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .role-summary {
    max-width: 820px;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .experience-list {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .experience-list li + li {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .project-grid,
  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .project-card,
  .skills-grid > div {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .project-card h2,
  .skills-grid h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .project-card p,
  .skills-grid p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .project-tech {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contact-section {
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .project-grid,
    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero {
      padding-block: 3.5rem;
    }

    .role-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .section {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }

    .role-block + .role-block {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      padding-top: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
